  "contentHtml": "\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 id=\"introduction\"><strong>Introduction :</strong></h2>\n<p><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-30637\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/spouse-visa-uae-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"Spouse visa UAE cost-overview\" width=\"892\" height=\"595\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/spouse-visa-uae-scaled.jpg 2560w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/12/spouse-visa-uae-300x200.jpg 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/12/spouse-visa-uae-1024x683.jpg 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/12/spouse-visa-uae-768x513.jpg 768w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/12/spouse-visa-uae-1536x1025.jpg 1536w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/12/spouse-visa-uae-2048x1367.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 892px) 100vw, 892px\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">One of the biggest wishes for expats is for their family to join them. That puts the </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">spouse visa UAE cost</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> on top of their priority list. This cost depends on how you apply, who sponsors, and which services you choose. We discuss in this guide the major factors that matter, what affects the total price, and how you can easily apply without any stress or worry.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"what-is-a-spouse-visa-in-uae\"><b>What is a spouse visa in UAE?</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Spouse visa UAE is one of the <a href=\"/type-of-residence-visa-in-uae/\">residence visa types</a>. This one allows a legally married husband or wife to live in the country under their partner’s sponsorship.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The visa is issued for a fixed validity period and ties the spouse’s legal status to the sponsor. It does not automatically allow work but it opens that door legally with the right permit.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The sponsor must be a valid UAE residence visa holder. Usually the applicants are employees, freelancers, and business owners who want their spouse to stay long term without separate employment sponsorship.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"why-spouse-visa-cost-matters\"><b>Why spouse visa cost matters</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Spouse visa UAE cost</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> is an important matter. Underestimating it causes delays, rejections, or rushed decisions later.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The costs vary based on visa type, emirate, service speed, and document status. Planning early helps you avoid repeat medicals, re attestations, and reapplications.&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h2 id=\"who-can-apply-and-sponsor-a-spouse-in-uae\"><b>Who Can Apply and Sponsor a Spouse in UAE</b></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sponsorship eligibility impacts who can apply for and sponsor their spouses in UAE:</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"eligibility-for-sponsor\"><b>Eligibility for sponsor</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You are eligible for sponsoring your spouse to UAE if you:</span></p>\n<ol>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">are a valid UAE residence visa holder</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">have a valid <a href=\"/emirates-id-verification-in-uae-2023/\">Emirates ID</a> and passport</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">have a residency address registered in the UAE</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">meet the income and accommodation expectations set by authorities</span></li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"requirements-for-spouse\"><b>Requirements for spouse:</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">UAE spouse visa requirements</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> consist of following:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The spouse must be legally married to the sponsor</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The marriage should be recognized and properly attested</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Passport and entry status should be valid</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The health check must be cleared</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"benefits-of-spouse-visa-uae\"><b>Benefits of Spouse Visa UAE</b></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A spouse visa offers you many benefits. We cover the major ones here:</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"legal-residency-with-spouse\"><b>Legal residency with spouse</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The biggest benefit is legal residency with your partner under one sponsorship. Spouse visa UAE allows stability, which matters when you are building a life here.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"access-to-healthcare-education-banking-utilities\"><b>Access to healthcare, education, banking, utilities</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">With a residence visa, your spouse can open bank accounts, get <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Health_insurance\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">health insurance</a>, enroll in schools, and register utilities. These basics often require Emirates ID, which only comes with legal residency.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"work-permit-options\"><b>Work permit options</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Can you work on a spouse visa in UAE? Yes, with a </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">work permit on spouse visa UAE</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> issued through an employer.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The visa itself does not restrict employment, but working without a permit does. This flexibility makes the visa attractive for professionals exploring roles or freelance options.</span></p>\n<h2 id=\"spouse-visa-uae-cost-fees\"><b>Spouse Visa UAE Cost &amp; Fees</b></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Spouse visa cost in UAE</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> depends on how many of these steps you handle yourself versus outsourcing.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"total-cost-breakdown\"><b>Total cost breakdown</b></h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Cost Component</b></td>\n<td><b>What It Covers</b></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Entry permit</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Initial approval to enter or change status</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Medical test</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Mandatory health screening</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Emirates ID</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Identity registration</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Visa stamping</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Residency confirmation</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Attestation</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Marriage certificate validation</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Service fees</span></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Typing, processing, PRO assistance</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"factors-affecting-the-cost\"><b>Factors affecting the cost</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The total </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">spouse visa UAE price</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> looks different for everyone. It changes based on application speed, emirate rules, visa validity length, and document readiness.&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Last minute applications, missing attestations, and urgent processing all affect what you pay. </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">How much the cost for a spouse visa in UAE</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> you will pay varies widely.</span></p>\n<h2 id=\"documents-required-for-spouse-visa-uae\"><b>Documents Required for Spouse Visa UAE</b></h2>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-30641 aligncenter\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/flat-lay-visa-application-assortment-scaled.webp\" alt=\"Documents required for UAE spouse visa application\" width=\"831\" height=\"554\"><noscript><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-30641 aligncenter\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/flat-lay-visa-application-assortment-scaled.webp\" alt=\"Documents required for UAE spouse visa application\" width=\"831\" height=\"554\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/flat-lay-visa-application-assortment-scaled.webp 2560w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/12/flat-lay-visa-application-assortment-300x200.webp 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/12/flat-lay-visa-application-assortment-1024x683.webp 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/12/flat-lay-visa-application-assortment-768x512.webp 768w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/12/flat-lay-visa-application-assortment-1536x1024.webp 1536w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/12/flat-lay-visa-application-assortment-2048x1365.webp 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 831px) 100vw, 831px\" /></noscript></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Having the right paperwork will only save you time.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"documents-for-applicant\"><b>Documents for applicant</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Documents required for spouse visa UAE</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> include passport copies, photographs, medical results, and entry status proof. Any mismatch in names or dates triggers queries.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"documents-for-sponsor\"><b>Documents for sponsor</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sponsors submit their visa copy, Emirates ID, salary proof, and tenancy contract. </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Spouse visa requirements UAE</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> apply equally to freelancers and employees, though proof formats differ.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"marriage-certificate-attestation-rules\"><b>Marriage certificate attestation rules</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Marriage certificates must be attested by relevant authorities and recognized in the UAE. Skipping or rushing this step leads to rejection. Attestation rules vary by country of issue, so planning matters.</span></p>\n<h2 id=\"sponsoring-a-spouse-after-freelance-or-employment-visa\"><b>Sponsoring a Spouse After Freelance or Employment Visa</b></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Your visa type changes how the application flows.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"sponsoring-on-freelance-visa\"><b>Sponsoring on freelance visa</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Freelancers can sponsor their spouse if their permit allows it and income supports sponsorship. Many assume freelance visas block family sponsorship even though that’s not true.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"sponsoring-on-employment-visa\"><b>Sponsoring on employment visa</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><a href=\"/employment-visa-uae/\">Employment visa</a> holders usually have a smoother path. Employer issued salary certificates simplify approval.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"key-differences-in-requirements\"><b>Key differences in requirements</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Freelancers submit business and permit documents. Employees submit employer letters. The end result is the same.</span></p>\n<h2 id=\"how-to-apply-for-spouse-visa-in-uae\"><b>How to Apply for Spouse Visa in UAE</b></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">When you know the process, it’s simple and easy to apply for a spouse visa in UAE.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"step-by-step-application-process\"><b>Step by step application process</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The process includes entry permit approval, medical testing, Emirates ID registration, and visa stamping. Each step depends on the previous one being cleared.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"online-and-offline-options\"><b>Online and offline options</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Applications can be started online or through service centers. Many clients prefer assisted applications to avoid repeat visits and rejections.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"common-mistakes-to-avoid\"><b>Common mistakes to avoid</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Most refusals are caused by:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">submitting unattested marriage certificates</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">wrong visa status changes</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">expired passports</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"uae-spouse-visa-processing-time\"><b>UAE Spouse Visa Processing Time</b></h2>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-30570 size-full\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Freelance-visa-application-process-step-by-step-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"Spouse visa in UAE \" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\"><noscript><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-30570 size-full\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Freelance-visa-application-process-step-by-step-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"Spouse visa in UAE \" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Freelance-visa-application-process-step-by-step-scaled.jpg 2560w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Freelance-visa-application-process-step-by-step-300x200.jpg 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Freelance-visa-application-process-step-by-step-1024x683.jpg 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Freelance-visa-application-process-step-by-step-768x512.jpg 768w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Freelance-visa-application-process-step-by-step-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Freelance-visa-application-process-step-by-step-2048x1365.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" /></noscript></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">UAE spouse visa processing time</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> depends on documentation quality and application method.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"average-processing-duration\"><b>Average processing duration</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Most applications complete within a few weeks when documents are ready. Delays happen when approvals are paused for clarification.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"reasons-for-delays\"><b>Reasons for delays</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Incomplete attestations, inconsistent names, and medical retests slow things down. Applying during peak periods also affects speed.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"tips-to-speed-up-approval\"><b>Tips to speed up approval</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">These are some tips for you to speed up the chances of your application’s approval:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Prepare documents in advance</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Verify name spellings</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Use a service provider if deadlines are a priority</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"work-rules-on-spouse-visa-uae\"><b>Work Rules on Spouse Visa UAE</b></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Working legally matters far more than most people initially realize.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"employer-responsibilities\"><b>Employer responsibilities</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Employers must apply for a work permit on spouse visa UAE before employment starts. This protects both parties.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"legal-rules-and-penalties\"><b>Legal rules and penalties</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Working without a permit leads to fines and visa cancellation. We always advise staying compliant to avoid long term issues.</span></p>\n<h2 id=\"difference-between-spouse-visa-and-family-visa\"><b>Difference Between Spouse Visa and Family Visa</b></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Spouse visa UAE is a type of family visa, but it applies specifically to married partners. <a href=\"/family-residence-visa-uae-cost\">Family visas</a> also cover children and parents. Sponsorship rules and documentation differ slightly but the cost logic remains similar.</span></p>\n<h2 id=\"pros-and-cons-of-spouse-visa-uae\"><b>Pros and Cons of Spouse Visa UAE</b></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Every visa has trade offs.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"advantages\"><b>Advantages</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You get residency stability, flexible work options, and easier access to services. It supports long term living plans.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"limitations\"><b>Limitations</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Your status depends on the sponsor. Visa cancellation affects dependents. Planning renewals matters.</span></p>\n<h2 id=\"final-thoughts-expert-tips\"><b>Final Thoughts &amp; Expert Tips</b></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Spouse visa UAE cost</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> depends on application method, documentation status, and processing speed. Benefits include legal residency, work flexibility, and access to essentials.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"who-should-apply-and-who-should-avoid\"><b>Who should apply and who should avoid</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This visa suits married couples planning long term stay. It may not suit those seeking short visits or uncertain residency timelines.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"expert-tips-to-save-time-and-avoid-rejection\"><b>Expert tips to save time and avoid rejection</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Prepare attestations early and review all your documents. Ask your service provider for guidance before submitting. We see fewer rejections when applications are reviewed professionally. If you want a smooth and stress-free process, contact Connect Freelance today for end-to-end spouse visa support.</span></p>\n<h2 id=\"faqs-about-spouse-visa-uae\"><b>FAQs About Spouse Visa UAE</b></h2>\n<h3 id=\"how-long-is-a-spouse-visa-valid-in-uae\"><b>How long is a spouse visa valid in UAE?</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Validity depends on the sponsor’s visa and chosen duration.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"how-to-renew-a-spouse-visa-and-cost\"><b>How to renew a spouse visa and cost?</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Renewal follows a similar process with updated medicals and Emirates ID. </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">UAE spouse visa renewal cost </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">varies based on services used.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"how-to-cancel-a-spouse-visa\"><b>How to cancel a spouse visa?</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You can have sponsor-initiated cancellation through immigration channels.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"can-you-work-on-a-spouse-visa-in-uae\"><b>Can you work on a spouse visa in UAE?</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Yes, you can legally work on a spouse visa with an approved work permit.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"how-to-get-a-spouse-visa-in-uae\"><b>How to get a spouse visa in UAE?</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">It starts with eligibility check, document preparation, and formal application.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"how-much-is-the-spouse-visa-fee\"><b>How much is the spouse visa fee?</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">It depends on factors discussed above. The cost of spouse visa in UAE varies case by case.</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"who-is-eligible-for-a-spouse-visa\"><b>Who is eligible for a spouse visa?</b></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Married partners of UAE residents meeting sponsorship rules qualify.</span><br>\n<script data-cfasync=\"false\" src=\"/cdn-cgi/scripts/5c5dd728/cloudflare-static/email-decode.min.js\"></script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n  \"mainEntity\": [\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"How long is a spouse visa valid in UAE?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"The validity of a UAE spouse visa depends on the sponsor’s visa type and the selected visa duration.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"How to renew a spouse visa and what is the cost?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Spouse visa renewal follows a similar process as the initial application, including updated medical tests and Emirates ID renewal. The UAE spouse visa renewal cost varies depending on the services and emirate.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"How to cancel a spouse visa in UAE?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"A spouse visa can be cancelled through sponsor-initiated cancellation using official immigration channels in the UAE.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Can you work on a spouse visa in UAE?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Yes, you can legally work in the UAE on a spouse visa after obtaining an approved work permit from the relevant authority.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"How to get a spouse visa in UAE?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"The process starts with checking eligibility, preparing the required documents, and submitting a formal application through UAE immigration channels.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"How much is the spouse visa fee in UAE?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"The spouse visa fee in the UAE depends on multiple factors such as visa duration, emirate, and services used, so costs may vary case by case.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Who is eligible for a spouse visa in UAE?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Married partners of UAE residents who meet the official sponsorship and income requirements are eligible for a UAE spouse visa.\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n</script></p>\n\n                \n                    <!--begin code -->\n\n                    \n                    <div class=\"pp-multiple-authors-boxes-wrapper pp-multiple-authors-wrapper pp-multiple-authors-layout-boxed multiple-authors-target-the-content box-post-id-22816 box-instance-id-1 ppma_boxes_22816\" data-post_id=\"22816\" data-instance_id=\"1\" data-additional_class=\"pp-multiple-authors-layout-boxed.multiple-authors-target-the-content\" data-original_class=\"pp-multiple-authors-boxes-wrapper pp-multiple-authors-wrapper box-post-id-22816 box-instance-id-1\">\n                                                                                    <h2 class=\"widget-title box-header-title\" id=\"author\">Author</h2>\n                                                                            <span class=\"ppma-layout-prefix\"></span>\n                        <div class=\"ppma-author-category-wrap\">\n                                                                                                                                    <span class=\"ppma-category-group ppma-category-group-1 category-index-0\">\n                                                                                                                        <ul class=\"pp-multiple-authors-boxes-ul author-ul-0\">\n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     